{"name":"RUSH: HALLOWEEN","aliases":["Rush Halloween Johannesburg 2026","RUSH Unholy Alliances and Questionable Costumes"],"city":"johannesburg","date":"2026-10-31","start_date":"2026-10-31","end_date":"2026-11-01","description":"RUSH: HALLOWEEN is Johannesburg queer nightlife in costume-crisis mode: rooftop daylight, two room identities and enough bad decisions to make the 03:00 exit feel almost ceremonial.","link":"https://www.rushclub.co.za/events/rush-halloween","ticket_url":"https://www.rushclub.co.za/events/rush-halloween","location":"Level Three, Kramerville Place, 14A Kramer Road, Kramerville, Sandton, Gauteng 2090, South Africa","lat":-26.1057,"lng":28.0673,"vibe":"queer-led rooftop-to-club Halloween takeover with cosplay chaos and two distinct dance areas","intel":{"hours":"16:00 Saturday 31 October–03:00 Sunday 1 November 2026.","entry_wait":"Advance tickets begin at R100. Guest-list requests do not guarantee admission, so arrive early with your ticket and original matching photo ID.","best_arrival":"Doors are at 16:00; arrive in daylight for the rooftop, lower queue pressure and the full rooftop-to-main-room changeover.","crowd_mix":"Queer Johannesburg, allies, costume maximalists, rooftop socialisers and late-night dancers moving between the main floor and Bubble Room.","dress_code":"A Halloween alter ego is the point. Costumes are encouraged, while standard safety screening and venue rules still apply.","host_inclusivity":"Rush is queer-led and ally-friendly, with explicit removal consequences for discrimination, harassment, unwanted sexual conduct and intimidation.","lineup":"No acts are announced on the current official listing; the event publishes two areas: Roof-Top Main and Bubble Room.","age_limit":"18+; original valid government-issued photo ID may be requested.","source_urls":["https://www.rushclub.co.za/events/rush-halloween"],"research_status":"official_date_hours_full_address_rooms_age_ticketing_and_inclusion_policy_verified_lineup_pending",