{"name":"Extra Dirty: Ben Manson","aliases":["Extra Dirty October 2026 Ben Manson Paris","Extra Dirty Sydney long weekend 2026"],"city":"sydney","date":"2026-10-04","start_date":"2026-10-04","end_date":"2026-10-05","description":"Extra Dirty marks 18 years of Sydney sweat with Ben Manson and its resident troublemakers: fetish-coded techno and dirty house for the people who understand that a good dance floor can be both disciplined and obscene.","link":"https://kikii.com.au/events/extra-dirty-october-2026-featuring-ben-manson-paris","ticket_url":"https://events.humanitix.com/extra-dirty-october-2026-featuring-ben-manson-paris","location":"Space Nightclub, Level 2, The Shark Building, 127 Liverpool Street, Sydney NSW 2000, Australia","lat":-33.8764,"lng":151.2073,"vibe":"Sydney queer leather-and-fetish techno: dirty house, body-positive heat and a serious long-weekend floor","intel":{"hours":"21:00 Sunday 4 October–03:30 Monday 5 October 2026.","entry_wait":"Final-release tickets are listed; purchase before arrival, as the event has an established following and limited remaining allocation.","best_arrival":"Get there at 21:00 for the room’s full build; it also beats the late queue at a 1,000-capacity club.","crowd_mix":"Queer, gay, leather and fetish communities plus techno and dirty-house dancers of all identities who respect the sex-positive room.","dress_code":"Kink/sex-positive styling is the published code. Leather, fetish and body-positive looks fit; make sure your outfit works for a long set.","host_inclusivity":"Extra Dirty is a long-running Sydney queer party and explicitly welcomes all aesthetics and identities while centring queer, gay, leather and fetish crowds.","lineup":"Ben Manson (Paris) with resident Extra Dirty DJs.","age_limit":"Confirm in the active ticket flow; Australian licensed nightlife entry normally requires photo ID.","source_urls":["https://kikii.com.au/events/extra-dirty-october-2026-featuring-ben-manson-paris"],"research_status":"event_l