{"name":"Dykadellic: The Ultimate Lesbian Boat Party","aliases":["Dykadellic Inception Sydney 2026","Dykadellic King Street Wharf October 2026"],"city":"sydney","date":"2026-10-17","start_date":"2026-10-17","end_date":"2026-10-17","description":"Dykadellic takes Sydney Harbour by force of glamour: three levels, six DJs and a boat built for sapphic mischief, with techno in the middle and no patience for a late boarding straggler.","link":"https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/dykadellic-the-ultimate-lesbian-boat-party-x-inception-sat-17-oct-2026-tickets-1999883684937","ticket_url":"https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/dykadellic-the-ultimate-lesbian-boat-party-x-inception-sat-17-oct-2026-tickets-1999883684937","location":"King Street Wharf, Lime Street, Darling Harbour, Sydney NSW 2000, Australia","lat":-33.8703,"lng":151.2028,"vibe":"three-level sapphic Sydney Harbour cruise with pop, techno, funk and daytime queer joy","intel":{"hours":"14:30–18:30 Saturday 17 October 2026; check-in is 13:30–14:00 and boarding is at 14:30 sharp.","entry_wait":"Do not arrive at boarding time: wristband check-in is earlier and the boat will not wait for late guests.","best_arrival":"Reach King Street Wharf between 13:30 and 14:00, then use the first part of the cruise to map the three levels and four bars.","crowd_mix":"Lesbian, trans, queer and genderqueer guests, allies who embrace the space, and dancers moving between pop, techno and funk decks.","dress_code":"The published theme is ‘I’m on a boat’; sequins and captain fantasy are welcome, but sun, wind and steep inter-level stairs make secure footwear smart.","host_inclusivity":"Dykadellic explicitly welcomes lesbian, trans, queer, genderqueer people and supportive allies; discounted access is available for several community groups by organiser contact.","lineup":"Six DJs across three levels: pop on top, techno in the middle and funk on the lower level; individual names remain subject to change.","age_limit":"18+; photo ID required.","source_urls":["https://www.eventbrite.com.au/e/dykadellic-the-ultimate-lesbian-boat-party-x-inception-sat-17-oct-2026-tickets-1999883684937"],"research_status":"official_ticketing_date_hours_meeting_point_music_layout_accessibility_and_inclusion_policy_verified","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"}},
{"name":"Sapphic Session","aliases":["04 Butch Club Sapphic Session Wellington 2026","Sapphic Session International Lesbian Day Wellington"],"city":"wellington","date":"2026-10-17","start_date":"2026-10-17","end_date":"2026-10-17","description":"Sapphic Session makes Wellington’s FLINTA* talent impossible to scroll past: an intimate night of live local music, open-mic bravery and International Lesbian Day energy built by the people it is for.","link":"https://events.humanitix.com/sapphic-session","ticket_url":"https://events.humanitix.com/sapphic-session","location":"The Hunter Lounge, 1 Kelburn Parade, Kelburn, Wellington 6012, New Zealand","lat":-41.2908,"lng":174.7680,"vibe":"Wellington FLINTA* live-music social: sapphic talent, open-mic nerve and International Lesbian Day warmth","intel":{"hours":"19:00–23:00 Saturday 17 October 2026.","entry_wait":"Tickets are sold through Humanitix with refunds available until seven days before the event; reserve ahead to support the small community-room format.","best_arrival":"Arrive for the opening half-hour if you want the open-mic/karaoke welcome rather than only the programmed live sets.","crowd_mix":"Sapphic and FLINTA* musicians, butch-community regulars, supportive queer friends and people looking for local live music rather than a big-room club.","dress_code":"No prescribed look. Comfortable, expressive clothes work best for a lounge setting that prioritises listening, singing and conversation.","host_inclusivity":"04 Butch Club makes this a dedicated FLINTA* space and states clear boundaries against TERFs and SWERFs; respectful guests are invited to support the micro-community.","lineup":"The Mad Butches, the 2026 Make a Band project, plus local sapphic and FLINTA* talent from Te Whanganui-a-Tara.","age_limit":"Confirm directly with the organiser before attending.","source_urls":["https://events.humanitix.com/sapphic-session"],"research_status":"official_ticketing_date_hours_full_address_format_access_policy_and_programme_verified","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:00:00Z"}}
